From 2f34f8e4bd414bb09ee4b0fa514a8919256fa797 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:26:06 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Add group schedule/metadata, 4-state join policy, and
 invite lifecycle UX

Groups now carry subject/grade/language/format/schedule fields and a
join policy (AUTO / APPROVAL / MANUAL) replacing the old binary
auto-join toggle; migration 0007 backfills existing groups from
autoJoinEnabled. Invite codes gain independent activate/deactivate and
expiry controls alongside regenerate. Join flows (code entry, /join/:code,
/invite/:token, and the student dashboard's inline join form) now share
a richer group preview before confirming, with live code normalization
and new error states for inactive/expired codes and MANUAL groups that
don't accept self-join.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
