From 3a04d6fb9cf1fa3ce42949bf69339bbe94dcb087 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:26:13 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add minimal admin console UI

The admin backend (suspend/unsuspend/revoke-sessions, audit log,
security events) existed with no client to drive it, and the
users.search/users.view permissions were declared but had no backing
procedures. Adds searchUsers/getUser to server/modules/admin/users.ts
and wires them into adminRouter.ts, then a functional /admin console
(users search + detail + suspend/unsuspend/revoke via a reason-required
dialog, audit log table, security events list with review action) with
a Shield icon entry point in the account menu, shown only to admins.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AdQkr4Q6EZdksQ1t4R55We
